      "issue": "Combat cues are generally readable; larger particle bursts can briefly erase tiny actors, and all small enemy species currently have very similar values against terrain.",
      "fix": "Enemy art family redesign (separately in progress), review hurt/death/windup silhouettes over actual regional backgrounds, maintain restrained scenery value contrast.",
      "source": "src/entities/enemies and src/fx/particles.rs",
